<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1488212875"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536339940"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Bring Me Back (feat. Claire Ridgely)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Miles Away"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Bring Me Back (feat. Claire Ridgely)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:39.000"><div begin="00:06.605" end="03:18.901"><p begin="00:06.605" end="00:09.407" itunes:key="L1">I've always been afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我时常担心着</span></p><p begin="00:09.407" end="00:13.461" itunes:key="L2">My best years have passed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我最好的年华已经逝去</span></p><p begin="00:13.461" end="00:16.307" itunes:key="L3">They say the good ol' days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人们说美好的时光</span></p><p begin="00:16.307" end="00:19.742" itunes:key="L4">Well, they never last<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是转瞬即逝</span></p><p begin="00:19.742" end="00:20.598" itunes:key="L5">I've been<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我脑海</span></p><p begin="00:20.598" end="00:23.144" itunes:key="L6">Running into you in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是浮现你的模样</span></p><p begin="00:23.144" end="00:27.480" itunes:key="L7">In between, what could've been, yeah, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们之间究竟是什么关系呢</span></p><p begin="00:27.480" end="00:29.998" itunes:key="L8">Everybody seems to leave<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎所有的人都会离开</span></p><p begin="00:29.998" end="00:34.277" itunes:key="L9">Bittersweet memories<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦甜参半的回忆里</span></p><p begin="00:34.277" end="00:41.112" itunes:key="L10">Time does seem to fly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉光阴就如流水</span></p><p begin="00:41.112" end="00:48.399" itunes:key="L11">Then it's hard to find, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法抓住无法寻回</span></p><p begin="00:48.399" end="00:50.345" itunes:key="L12">Used to dine and dash<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经吃霸王餐</span></p><p begin="00:50.345" end="00:51.750" itunes:key="L13">Run and laugh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">匆忙逃跑 尽情欢笑</span></p><p begin="00:51.750" end="00:53.839" itunes:key="L14">Skinny dip off a ship<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳下船冲入海裸泳</span></p><p begin="00:53.839" end="00:58.737" itunes:key="L15">Oh woah, not a worry for a million miles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不担心相隔万里</span></p><p begin="00:58.737" end="01:01.542" itunes:key="L16">Driving off, be right back, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱车离去 不久便会相见</span></p><p begin="01:01.542" end="01:04.067" itunes:key="L17">'Cause, baby, after all of this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为宝贝经过一切之后</span></p><p begin="01:04.067" end="01:08.394" itunes:key="L18">We'll meet again, with time to spend<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将会再次相遇 共度美好时光</span></p><p begin="01:08.394" end="01:11.171" itunes:key="L19">'Cause even after all of this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为宝贝经过一切之后</span></p><p begin="01:11.171" end="01:12.629" itunes:key="L20">Would you be mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会是我的伴侣吗</span></p><p begin="01:12.629" end="01:15.485" itunes:key="L21">'Cause I'd drop it all just to get you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我愿抛下所有 只为来到你的身旁</span></p><p begin="01:29.141" end="01:36.010" itunes:key="L22">Bring me back to life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我重获新生</span></p><p begin="01:36.010" end="01:42.655" itunes:key="L23">Bring me back to life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我重获新生</span></p><p begin="01:42.655" end="01:45.375" itunes:key="L24">I've always dreamed too big<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我总是会抱有远大理想</span></p><p begin="01:45.375" end="01:49.510" itunes:key="L25">For this little town<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这座小镇中</span></p><p begin="01:49.510" end="01:56.495" itunes:key="L26">But now I can't remember how to slow it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是现在我已忘记如何放慢脚步</span></p><p begin="01:56.495" end="02:03.401" itunes:key="L27">Time does seem to fly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉光阴就如流水</span></p><p begin="02:03.401" end="02:09.453" itunes:key="L28">Then it's hard to find, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法抓住无法寻回</span></p><p begin="02:09.453" end="02:12.810" itunes:key="L29">I've grown tired of being stuck in a race<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已厌倦争夺</span></p><p begin="02:12.810" end="02:14.569" itunes:key="L30">Office space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">工作上的事情</span></p><p begin="02:14.569" end="02:17.180" itunes:key="L31">It's all fake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全是一片假象</span></p><p begin="02:17.180" end="02:19.707" itunes:key="L32">Everybody seems to cheat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎所有的人都在背叛</span></p><p begin="02:19.707" end="02:24.379" itunes:key="L33">Best believe, that's not me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最好相信这绝不会是我</span></p><p begin="02:24.379" end="02:27.865" itunes:key="L34">Want a midnight sky, rolling high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要体验午夜极致欢乐</span></p><p begin="02:27.865" end="02:31.321" itunes:key="L35">Take a trip on a whim, oh woah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来一场说走就走的旅行</span></p><p begin="02:31.321" end="02:34.657" itunes:key="L36">Not a worry for a million miles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不担心相隔万里</span></p><p begin="02:34.657" end="02:37.602" itunes:key="L37">Flying off be right back, oh woah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由翱翔 不久便会相见</span></p><p begin="02:37.602" end="02:40.050" itunes:key="L38">'Cause maybe after all of this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为或许经过一切之后</span></p><p begin="02:40.050" end="02:44.356" itunes:key="L39">We'd meet again, with time to spend<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将会再次相遇 共度美好时光</span></p><p begin="02:44.356" end="02:47.157" itunes:key="L40">'Cause even after all this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为经过一切之后</span></p><p begin="02:47.157" end="02:48.655" itunes:key="L41">Would you be mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会是我的伴侣吗</span></p><p begin="02:48.655" end="02:51.469" itunes:key="L42">'Cause I'd drop it all just to get you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我愿抛下所有 只为来到你的身旁</span></p><p begin="03:05.159" end="03:12.045" itunes:key="L43">Bring me back to life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我重获新生</span></p><p begin="03:12.045" end="03:18.901" itunes:key="L44">Bring me back to life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我重获新生</span></p></div></body></tt>